{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/e4624672ea5f313d06baef13f9a1b249.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 An Epic Three Kingdoms Adventure Penned by You \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flames of war rage, and heroes rise from all corners. You, a promising warrior, step resolutely into this tumultuous era of the Three Kingdoms. Your story is not a mere footnote in history books, but a brand-new legend woven from countless quests, battles, and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/bf6a4cdff64c8fd59f66350c8e6c7773.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Quest-Driven, Explore a Vast World \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on commissions from townfolk, gather intelligence on enemy forces, challenge formidable warlords dominating the regions... Your adventure is propelled by a series of thrilling quests. Each journey will lead you to new maps with distinct styles: from bustling <strong>Central Plains towns</strong> to grim <strong>frontier fortresses</strong>, and further into mysterious <strong>deep mountain caves</strong>. Unknown challenges and rewards always await ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/5a0376b40f87e4cf4ac36dd3efc11b19.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/1b0e33300c8da9aefe20711c899b7b6d.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Focused Progression, Master Flashy Martial Arts \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title ditches complex gear systems, allowing you to focus entirely on the core <strong>action experience</strong>.<br>Earn rewards through combat and seek out masters to learn new <strong>active skills</strong> and <strong>passive talents</strong>. From swift spear techniques to overwhelming area-of-effect cleaves, from agile dodges to empowering auras\u2014forge your unique combat style. Skillfully combine your abilities to unleash stunning combos on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/1a593e6583059d4c538a4957fa4f22eb.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/2512dc4ffaeb2298fbf534b0361519f4.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Fluid Combat, Low-Spec Friendly \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are committed to delivering the purest action-adventure fun. Thus, the game is built on an optimized engine\u2014<strong>no top-tier graphics card needed, it runs smoothly even on entry-level PCs!</strong>Whether on a hefty gaming laptop or a lightweight office computer, you can be immersed in this Three Kingdoms world anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/92b50fdf40b14bdb194a0c79378ed181.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Spark in the Embers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea