verwhelming area-of-effect cleaves, from agile dodges to empowering auras\u2014forge your unique combat style. Skillfully combine your abilities to unleash stunning combos on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/1a593e6583059d4c538a4957fa4f22eb.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/2512dc4ffaeb2298fbf534b0361519f4.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Fluid Combat, Low-Spec Friendly \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are committed to delivering the purest action-adventure fun. Thus, the game is built on an optimized engine\u2014<strong>no top-tier graphics card needed, it runs smoothly even on entry-level PCs!</strong>Whether on a hefty gaming laptop or a lightweight office computer, you can be immersed in this Three Kingdoms world anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/extras/92b50fdf40b14bdb194a0c79378ed181.avif?t=1773747358\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["YEZHUGAME"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979220/1c52b471e807f2edc4e8f323da5017844721cc3d/header.jpg?t=1773747358","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"ma